{"lines":[{"t":"Test 2","x":0.065853115936159418,"y":0.038963880713577481,"w":0.06417005538940429,"h":0.015095494035686108,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.027616278921111181,"h":0.026162790958138005,"t":"@cambridgematerials","x":0.56494845626860124,"w":0.32989690144856776},{"x":0.43298969293851219,"h":0.018895349149765539,"t":"SPEAKING","c":1,"y":0.08139534865670639,"w":0.16082473754882809},{"t":"PART 1","x":0.0659521200846198,"y":0.14670937356916247,"w":0.10933287302652996,"h":0.016174276086490247,"c":1},{"h":0.018895349149765539,"c":1,"y":0.1773255812337331,"t":"The examiner asks the candidate about him\/herself, his\/her home, work or studies and","x":0.063917527910812552,"w":0.87628865559895841},{"h":0.019183341993420311,"c":1,"w":0.20902695973714192,"t":"other familiar topics.","x":0.06361430202604168,"y":0.19463237966124036},{"x":0.065979382456526681,"y":0.22529069771197641,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"EXAMPLE","w":0.10927834828694663,"c":1},{"y":0.25436046511246846,"t":"Friends","x":0.065979381862941722,"h":0.014534883616744709,"c":1,"w":0.08247422536214194},{"t":"• How often do you go out with friends? [Why\/Why not?]","x":0.061855673671232882,"h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.28332354675736082,"w":0.58350514729817704,"c":1},{"t":"• Tell me about your best friend at school.","h":0.017441861012089777,"y":0.30232558111768937,"w":0.43917526245117189,"c":1,"x":0.061855667640393408},{"c":1,"t":"• How friendly are you with your neighbours? [Why\/Why not?]","y":0.31972988820750592,"w":0.63711339314778648,"h":0.017615971814445075,"x":0.061855674471374536},{"w":0.61254887898763033,"c":1,"y":0.33693335323915075,"t":"• Which is more important to you, friends or family? [Why?]","h":0.020219921575737709,"x":0.061777822380880282},{"x":0.061855670655446268,"y":0.37345860238513184,"w":0.11134020487467448,"t":"PART 2","h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Describe a writer you would like to meet.","y":0.41855505585010166,"w":0.44350575764973965,"h":0.018370582997203844,"x":0.08855352